            "notes": "Round 3 is big for us. Aura farming really does proc constantly, and the extra overhealth can win teamfights. You can probably afford to play a bit more aggressively now, being a temporary standin for your tank. \n\nDO NOT TRY TO 1V5 THE ENEMY TEAM HOWEVER - THIS WILL NOT END WELL! You're still a support at the end of the day after all.\n\nYou might be thinking our weapon and ability power is looking low. Yes, this is true. However, gloomgauntlet actually adds +15% melee damage, so we're really sitting closer to 20% weapon power. Additionally, our attack speed should always be +10% higher, as it's very rare that you aren't going to be healing somebody at this stage by actively participating in teamfights.",
