            "notes": "Right, final power time, and we have so many options.\n\nWant more healing? Packstacker is great, however I'd be inclined to lean towards Mender Bender instead, to maintain survivability and use your shield bash as an escape tool. Getting inspire procs from something you do naturally is always great.\n\nYour other options is Burst Aid, if you want a splash of extra dps. However I'd probably avoid this myself, as those repair pack charges really do come in handy when healing up your team.\n\nFinally, let's replace burst Aid with Dragon's Incinerator. We get rally up incredibly frequently, and having it last longer is always nice. Oh, also the burn damage is a thing I guess.",
